{
    "title": "AP News: World & Local",
    "description": "Bringing you breaking news from the Associated Press and hundreds of trusted local and international sources, AP News is your trusted source for real-time world news coverage anytime and anywhere. With articles in both English and Spanish, AP News by The Associated Press provides a personalized news experience, the most important and timely headlines and Pulitzer Prize-winning journalism. \r\n\r\nHere's some of what you'll see inside: \r\n\u00b7 Live coverage of important local news stories as they happen \r\n\u00b7 Curated content hubs for deeper insights into major world news events, sports news and story lines. \r\n\u00b7 AP's award-winning photography from U.S. and global news events \r\n\u00b7 Quick, informative videos that capture the stories that you and your friends are talking about. \r\n\u00b7 Local news stories from newspapers and broadcasters. \r\n\u00b7 AP Top 25 Sports Polls. \r\n\r\nThe AP is the most trusted source of news on Election Night in the U.S. We're also covering consequential elections across the globe that this year that will shape the world we live in. \r\n\r\nAP News. Advancing the power of facts.",
